        "category": "taiwan_aviation",
        "headline": "屏東縣府與長榮航空邀德國旅遊業者踩線 為拓展歐洲市場奠基",
        "summary": "屏東縣府與長榮航空邀請德國慕尼黑的戶外運動及特色旅遊業者赴屏東，進行六天五夜踩線，體驗山林探索、生態賞鳥、海洋運動及原住民族行程。縣府表示，此次合作串聯國際航線與地方觀光資源，為拓展歐洲市場奠基，並盼將景點、專業導覽及戶外活動轉化為符合歐洲需求的旅遊商品。",
        "headline_en": "Pingtung County and EVA Air Host German Tourism Operators on Scouting Visit to Lay Groundwork for European Expansion",
        "summary_en": "Pingtung County Government and EVA Air invited outdoor-sports and specialty-tourism operators from Munich, Germany, to Pingtung for a six-day, five-night scouting visit featuring mountain exploration, birdwatching, marine sports and Indigenous cultural experiences. The county said the collaboration links international routes with local tourism resources, laying groundwork for European-market expansion and aiming to turn attractions, guided tours and outdoor activities into products suited to European demand.",
